    母题2. first occurrence of the target
        Ex. given a sorted array = {1,2,2,2,4}, find the first occurrence of target = 2

        solution:
            这时会出现两种case：
                1. target > & < mid 正常缩小range就好
                2. target == mid
                因为要找first occurrence，所以当mid=target的时候我们就不能轻易返回，因为我们不知道这个值到底是不是first occurrence 
                所以就只能保留mid, 令right=mid，但是如果array中剩下最后一个元素时且这个元素为target时，left=right=mid，依旧符合left<=right，所以会陷入死循环
                
                对于这个问题，解决办法是将循环条件变为left < right - 1, 之后再对剩下的这个区间内的元素一个个进行验证
                left < right - 1的意思是剩下3个元素没看[left, right - 1, right]

            但是感觉会有点不太直观，所以我个人推荐另外一种写法，利用一个额外的变量来暂时存放合适的index
            代码如下:
                public int binarySearch(int[] range, int target){
                    int left = 0;
                    int right = range.length-1;
                    int result = -1;

                    while(left <= right){
                        int mid = left + (right - left)/2
                        if(target == range[mid]){
                            result = mid;
                            right = mid-1 //暂时存放合适的index，向左找更早的
                        }
                        else if(range[mid] > target){
                            right = mid + 1;
                        }
                        else if(range[mid] < target){
                            left = mid - 1;
                        }
                    }
                    return result;
                }

    子题1. last occurrence of the target
        Ex. given a sorted array = {1,2,2,2,4}, find the last occurrence of target = 2

        solution: 这个就比较简单了，参考first occurrence，如果想找last occurrence，我们就稍微改动target == range[mid]条件时的代码为：
            if(target == range[mid]){
                result = mid;
                left = mid + 1
            }
            即可，意思是以现在的这个mid为基准，向右缩小搜索范围，找更晚的符合条件的index

    子题2. smallest larger than target
        Ex. given a target integer T and an integer array A sorted in ascending order, find the index of the 
            smallest element in A that is larget than T or return -1 if there is no such index

            Example:
                A = {1,2,3}, T = 1, return 1
                A = {1,2,3}, T = 3, return -1
                A = {1,2,2,2,3}, T = 1, return 1

        solution: 这个题翻译翻译，其实就是求first occurrence的题目
            为什么？
            因为我们larger than target的有很多, 我们只需要找到这些元素中的first occurrence就好

            代码如下:
                public int smallestLargerBinarySearch(int[] range, int target){
                    int left = 0;
                    int right = range.length - 1;
                    int result = -1;

                    while(left <= right){
                        int mid = left + (right - left)/2;
                        if(range[mid] > target){
                            result = mid;
                            right = mid - 1;
                        }
                        else{
                            left = mid + 1;
                        }
                        return result = -1;
                    }
                }

            类似的变体：
                largest smaller than target -> last occurrence of element such that array[index] < target
                smallest larger or equal than target -> first occurrence of element such that array[index] >= target
                largest smaller or equal than target -> last occurrence of element such that array[index] <= target

    子题3. BS in 2D matrix
        Ex. given a 2D matrix {{1,2,3}, {4,5,6}, {7,8,9}}，find the target = 5;

        solution:
            对于2Dmatrix，我们可以把它铺平为1D array，就可以进行BS
            如何转换？可以利用公式将2d的坐标进行转化:
                2D Row = 1D index / colLength
                2D Col = 1D index % colLength

            代码如下:
                public int[] matrixBinarySearch(int[][] range, int target){
                    int col = range[0].length;
                    int row = range.length;

                    int left = 0;
                    int right = row*col - 1;

                    while(left <= right){
                        int mid = left + (right - left)/2;

                        int midRow = mid / col;
                        int midCol = mid % col;

                        if(range[midRow][midCol] == target){
                            return new int[]{midRow, midCol};
                        }
                        else if(range[midRow][midCol] > target){
                            right = mid - 1;
                        }
                        else{
                            left = mid + 1;
                        }
                    }
                    return {-1,-1} 
                }

    子题4. closest in sorted array 
        Ex. given a sorted array, a target, return index of the closest element to the target
            
            sample: A = {1,2,3}, T = 2, return 1;
                    A = {1,4,6}, T = 3, return 1;
                    A = {1,4,6}, T = 5, return 1 or 2;
                    A = {1,3,3,4}, T = 2, return 0 or 1 or 2;
            
            solution: 子题肯定是母题的变体，对于这个题，其实就是first occurrence和last occurrence的变体
                对于target，我们找到比它大的所有的first occurrence和比它小的所有的last occurrence，然后比较三者之间的差值找最小即可

            代码如下:
                课程的标准版，思路是一样的，但是写的比我自己想的版本要简单一些(我的想法是利用两次BS分别求)：
                public int findCloestToTarget(int[] range, int target){
                    int left = 0;
                    int right = range.length-1;
                    int largerMin = 0;
                    int smallerMax = 0;

                    while(left <= right){
                        int mid = left + (right - left)/2;
                        if(range[mid] == target){
                            return mid;
                        }
                        else if(range[mid] > target){
                            largerMin = mid;
                            right = mid - 1;
                        }
                        else{
                            smallerMax = mid;
                            left = mid + 1;
                        }
                    }

                    if(Math.abs(range[largerMin] - target) > Math.abs(range[smallerMax] - target)){
                        return smallerMax;
                    }
                    else{
                        return largerMin;
                    }
                }

    
    